r935 | fmirani | 2014-05-08 13:24:46 -0700 (Thu, 08 May 2014) | 9 lines

hwmon-lf3000 - FWSCRUM-1056 : False Battery Reading 
ADC seems to misbehave at times and reads a low value and causes 
low/critical battery event. This behavior is seen mostly - 
-on device bootup
-when a game cartridge is inserted and game is launched
- while playing videos. 
Doing 3 adc reads and taking a median 3 of them seems to help  


************************************

